OL,3,GNEWSAScotland has right to decide
OL,4,Aconstitutional future, new Scottish
OL,5,ALabour leader says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe new leader of Scottish Labour has
OL,8,Fbacked Scotland's right to decide its
OL,9,Fconstitutional future.
OL,11,FBBC News understands Michael Marra's
OL,12,Fparty is willing to support that
OL,13,Fposition in a non-binding vote at
OL,14,FHolyrood later.
OL,16,FLabour remains opposed to independence
OL,17,Fand another referendum, with Marra
OL,18,Fchallenging the SNP to show that
OL,19,Fconstitutional change is the "settled
OL,20,Fwill" of the country before a second
OL,21,Fvote is held.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
