OL,3,GNEWSAScotland has right to decide
OL,4,Aconstitutional future, new Scottish
OL,5,ALabour leader says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government has argued that
OL,8,Fa majority of pro-independence MSPs at
OL,9,FHolyrood represents a mandate for a
OL,10,Fsecond referendum, though Prime
OL,11,FMinister Andy Burnham has said such a
OL,12,Fballot is "off limits".
